# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/

# This project is managed by POETRY — `poetry.lock` is what the build and CI
# use. A `uv.lock` appears the moment anybody runs `uv run` here, and one was
# committed by accident that way: nothing reads it, it drifts silently, and it
# tells the next contributor the wrong thing about which tool manages this
# project.
uv.lock
.coverage

# PRDs live in the INTERNAL stonedog-prd repo, never here. `docs/prd` is a
# symlink into it, so the documents are where a person expects while this
# repository commits none of them. See the StoneDogCode CLAUDE.md.
docs/prd
